#: ../../06-workflows.md:39 63424fd1d5f843c5969a75c97532aef1
msgid "Workflow 1"
msgstr "工作流 1"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:41 ../../06-workflows.md:126
#: ../../06-workflows.md:150 66808f46ebc344548b9603ce77582f55
#: 8d66e63c3d2a42529e239c3b00887a8c f57dc998b8df43ce903914b57de61562
msgid "Trigger and Goal"
msgstr "触发条件与目标"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:43 97cd02b640884a3a8c01c818149cf829
msgid ""
"**Trigger**: Lua or an HTTP upstream connects to a hostname that is not "
"already an address literal."
msgstr "**触发条件**：Lua 或 HTTP 上游连接到一个并非地址字面量的主机名。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:44 b97b6bfe0c224586803afe68049277ca
msgid ""
"**Goal**: Turn that name into one or more addresses, then continue the TCP "
"connect. On failure, surface a stable error string to Lua, or finalize the "
"upstream request."
msgstr "**目标**：将该名字转换为一个或多个地址，然后继续 TCP 连接。失败时，向 Lua 暴露稳定的错误字符串，或终结上游请求。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:46 6ec312c3c6f143b1ad8d56c04f9b4fa6
msgid ""
"`lua-resty-http` is not vendored in this repository. It only creates a "
"cosocket and calls `connect()`. DNS itself is Nginx `ngx_resolver`."
msgstr ""
"`lua-resty-http` 未随本仓库 vendored。它只创建 cosocket 并调用 `connect()`。DNS 本身由 Nginx "
"`ngx_resolver` 处理。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:48 ../../06-workflows.md:133
#: ../../06-workflows.md:157 04e1b978fa784d5c9524cf961c5607be
#: 417718522f364ac18cdec2928ea69b3a 8af0550af0ed407c939d8e4a9f90feba
msgid "Main Flow"
msgstr "主流程"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:68 373c6c90699d42a592e6793ef2a434ea
msgid ""
"The resolve runs on the Nginx event loop. The Lua coroutine yields in "
"`connect()` and resumes in `ngx_http_lua_socket_resolve_handler`."
msgstr ""
"解析运行在 Nginx 事件循环上。Lua 协程在 `connect()` 中挂起，并在 "
"`ngx_http_lua_socket_resolve_handler` 中恢复。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:70 ../../06-workflows.md:142
#: 56b2c521d15d4284a882fccba12a6f57 6c2eee1663a04caab8124e5bbcbb8edb
msgid "Key Steps"
msgstr "关键步骤"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:72 5bdcc1cce16e473cbd4ec485e3e7e9e0
msgid ""
"`ngx_http_lua_socket_tcp_connect` parses the host. If "
"`u->resolved->sockaddr` is already set, it connects and does not call the "
"resolver. See "
"`openresty/bundle/ngx_lua-0.10.31rc5/src/ngx_http_lua_socket_tcp.c`."
msgstr ""
"`ngx_http_lua_socket_tcp_connect` 解析主机。如果 `u->resolved->sockaddr` "
"已设置，则直接连接而不调用解析器。参见 "
"`openresty/bundle/ngx_lua-0.10.31rc5/src/ngx_http_lua_socket_tcp.c`。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:73 2ccf25d018ec42249c6c606ebf94c9fa
msgid ""
"Otherwise it calls `ngx_resolve_start(clcf->resolver, ...)`. "
"`NGX_NO_RESOLVER` means the location has no `resolver` directive. Cosocket "
"does not read `/etc/resolv.conf` and does not call `getaddrinfo()`."
msgstr ""
"否则它会调用 `ngx_resolve_start(clcf->resolver, ...)`。`NGX_NO_RESOLVER` 表示该 "
"location 没有 `resolver` 指令。Cosocket 不读取 `/etc/resolv.conf`，也不调用 "
"`getaddrinfo()`。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:74 a3c4794a657f4b5a88ed2c41aa2bf728
msgid ""
"`ngx_resolve_name` looks up the name rbtree. A live cache entry returns "
"immediately. A miss builds a DNS query, sends it, and arms "
"`resolver_timeout` on that context (`ngx_resolver_set_timeout`)."
msgstr ""
"`ngx_resolve_name` 查找名称红黑树。命中的缓存条目立即返回。未命中则构建 DNS 查询并发送，同时在该上下文上设置 "
"`resolver_timeout`（`ngx_resolver_set_timeout`）。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:75 1d54f899a0c04621ae911967bd19f06b
msgid ""
"`ngx_resolver_process_response` checks the header, then "
"`ngx_resolver_process_a` handles A and AAAA answers, CNAME chains, and non-"
"zero RCODEs."
msgstr ""
"`ngx_resolver_process_response` 检查报头，然后 `ngx_resolver_process_a` 处理 A 和 AAAA"
" 应答、CNAME 链以及非零 RCODE。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:76 57153fa0d6ab48588f476f842e12bedb
msgid ""
"Every context on `rn->waiting` shares one in-flight query. On a terminal "
"RCODE the code walks that list, sets `ctx->state`, and calls each handler. "
"There is no function named `ngx_resolver_fail_waiting`."
msgstr ""
"`rn->waiting` 上的每个上下文共享一次进行中的查询。遇到终态 RCODE 时，代码遍历该列表，设置 `ctx->state` "
"并调用每个处理器。不存在名为 `ngx_resolver_fail_waiting` 的函数。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:77 3f0f48b29bd7484c9322073aaab56ca7
msgid ""
"The cosocket handler turns `ctx->state` into a Lua `nil, err` pair. "
"`proxy_pass` and other upstream hostname resolves use "
"`ngx_http_upstream_resolve_handler` instead."
msgstr ""
"cosocket 处理器将 `ctx->state` 转换为 Lua 的 `nil, err` 对。`proxy_pass` 和其他上游主机名解析改用 "
"`ngx_http_upstream_resolve_handler`。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:79 68ec105503fe44b191eb4ba729344d0a
msgid "Error and Edge Cases"
msgstr "错误与边界情况"

