msgid ""
"`ngx_http_lua_socket_tcp.c` when `ngx_resolve_start` returns "
"`NGX_NO_RESOLVER`"
msgstr ""
"`ngx_resolve_start` 返回 `NGX_NO_RESOLVER` 时的 `ngx_http_lua_socket_tcp.c`"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 ea251098f39b4a85a8e33dc1ffab539b
msgid ""
"Immediate Lua error `no resolver defined to resolve \"<host>\"`. Upstream "
"logs the same text and finalizes with 502."
msgstr "Lua 立即报错 `no resolver defined to resolve \"<host>\"`。上游记录相同文本并以 502 终结。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 ada2b30aca514a27802961f8aaa37404
msgid "`ngx_resolve_name` returns an error before a query is outstanding"
msgstr "`ngx_resolve_name` 在查询发出前返回错误"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 994db2f5ce6a4b09ba1030d4019332c8
msgid "same file, after `ngx_resolve_name`"
msgstr "同一文件，位于 `ngx_resolve_name` 之后"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 9554706b4dc2462d82e92855fd23c2a9
msgid ""
"Lua error `\"<host> could not be resolved\"` with no numeric code. Upstream "
"finalizes with 500."
msgstr "Lua 报错 `\"<host> could not be resolved\"`，无数字代码。上游以 500 终结。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 23e266cb25be43a4b9e557e57a3cd027
msgid "UDP send fails"
msgstr "UDP 发送失败"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 3005cc375b37453485cbf8ec455d7463
msgid "`ngx_resolve_name_locked` in `ngx_resolver.c`"
msgstr "`ngx_resolver.c` 中的 `ngx_resolve_name_locked`"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 93da01fb374345b78a2c032159ce909d
msgid "One immediate resend on the next nameserver."
msgstr "在下一个域名服务器上立即重发一次。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 fba858a9ee374567a2a5aa4fbc32076c
msgid "No reply before the per-query resend time"
msgstr "在每次查询的重发时间之前没有应答"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 e5da3690053f4befb6651dcff90e827d
msgid "`ngx_resolver_resend`"
msgstr "`ngx_resolver_resend`"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 a6a7398bbb9140e6ae2a6bc387042949
msgid ""
"If `rn->waiting` is still set, `last_connection` advances and the query is "
"sent again. `resend_timeout` is 5 seconds, set in `ngx_resolver_create`."
msgstr ""
"如果 `rn->waiting` 仍被设置，则推进 `last_connection` 并再次发送查询。`resend_timeout` 为 5 秒，在"
" `ngx_resolver_create` 中设置。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 ba21c74ee4e04f0a806d9ef8e7354b7a
msgid "`resolver_timeout` fires"
msgstr "`resolver_timeout` 触发"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 c64785845bb849c686eb6627f180f589
msgid "`ngx_resolver_timeout_handler`"
msgstr "`ngx_resolver_timeout_handler`"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 ece93e3518014bec871af31850109ab0
msgid ""
"That context gets `NGX_RESOLVE_TIMEDOUT` (`NGX_ETIMEDOUT`, 110 on Linux) and"
" its handler runs. Default merge value is 30000 ms in "
"`ngx_http_core_module.c`."
msgstr ""
"该上下文获得 `NGX_RESOLVE_TIMEDOUT`（`NGX_ETIMEDOUT`，Linux 上为 "
"110），其处理器运行。`ngx_http_core_module.c` 中合并后的默认值为 30000 ms。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 44186bac98e04c7f9b4e19c089fb2fbf
msgid "RCODE SERVFAIL, NXDOMAIN, NOTIMP, or REFUSED"
msgstr "RCODE SERVFAIL、NXDOMAIN、NOTIMP 或 REFUSED"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 fcfd43b3ce764849bb394d889751ac6a
msgid "`ngx_resolver_process_a` when `code` is non-zero"
msgstr "`code` 非零时的 `ngx_resolver_process_a`"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 126649f7124b43c8a69321a3f246b103
msgid ""
"Every waiter fails immediately with that code. The name node is removed from"
" the rbtree. This build does not rotate nameservers because of SERVFAIL."
msgstr "所有等待者立即以该代码失败。名称节点从红黑树中移除。此构建不会因 SERVFAIL 而轮换域名服务器。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 d6d0602ffcf749dd8a36a3286be2ea56
msgid "RCODE FORMERR, or a code above REFUSED"
msgstr "RCODE FORMERR，或高于 REFUSED 的代码"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 1ec4818ec82f4dacbc78ca64b3cd71ba
msgid "`ngx_resolver_process_response`"
msgstr "`ngx_resolver_process_response`"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 5d8399bc013b4bcb95a25105bcc4bda2
msgid ""
"Logged as `DNS error (...)` and dropped. Waiters stay until resend or "
"`resolver_timeout`."
msgstr "以 `DNS error (...)` 记录并丢弃。等待者保持直到重发或 `resolver_timeout`。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 f5643a15a8624b54b3ffac2ff2aa3f6c
msgid "NOERROR with an empty answer and no sibling A/AAAA"
msgstr "NOERROR 但应答为空且没有兄弟 A/AAAA 记录"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 3d6a03e7c5d84b639344c8f54d7bab21
#: 89f2f8f0cebb44d2922f60b90d4883d4 fccf07d7c5c14c449635076145f87308
