msgstr "`ngx_resolver_process_a`"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 932fe089cac44d5cac1458408d8e0f50
msgid "Treated as `NGX_RESOLVE_NXDOMAIN`."
msgstr "视为 `NGX_RESOLVE_NXDOMAIN`。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 4631a31ea1d5403ea76244ae6d1c2650
msgid "CNAME chain"
msgstr "CNAME 链"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 57d0950f3532490cb9890376b0cab2b5
msgid ""
"`ngx_resolve_name_locked` and the CNAME branch in `ngx_resolver_process_a`"
msgstr "`ngx_resolve_name_locked` 以及 `ngx_resolver_process_a` 中的 CNAME 分支"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 1fa12ed32b45445698a86f0f54f8d3e4
msgid ""
"Followed until `NGX_RESOLVER_MAX_RECURSION` (50). Past that, waiters fail "
"with `NGX_RESOLVE_NXDOMAIN`."
msgstr ""
"一直追踪到 `NGX_RESOLVER_MAX_RECURSION`（50）。超过后，等待者以 `NGX_RESOLVE_NXDOMAIN` 失败。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 674f6b46a7c64f57898c0bda3f2f30f7
msgid "Transaction id mismatch"
msgstr "事务 id 不匹配"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 8e4441ffcbed49908edf6b60d511fbb7
msgid ""
"Logged as `wrong ident ... expect` and ignored. The outstanding query is not"
" failed by that packet."
msgstr "以 `wrong ident ... expect` 记录并忽略。未完成的查询不会被该报文判为失败。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 776320a80c554f66b0b8bd066b857b5f
msgid "Label compression loop or a short packet"
msgstr "标签压缩循环或过短报文"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 fdfcde8a8363412dbddd5300e1787c8e
msgid "`ngx_resolver_copy` and the short-response path"
msgstr "`ngx_resolver_copy` 和短响应路径"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 8bbf8ba13a094c65b67b09ec742a2403
msgid ""
"Logged (`compression pointers loop` limit is 128) and the packet is dropped."
" Waiters stay until resend or timeout."
msgstr "记录（`compression pointers loop` 上限为 128）并丢弃该报文。等待者保持直到重发或超时。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 740c267b59f94d1c8d5feef47c155efb
msgid "UDP truncated (`TC`)"
msgstr "UDP 被截断（`TC`）"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:50 ae8d9a948db445c4ad793ffe9a0fa40f
msgid "Switches that query to TCP via `ngx_resolver_send_tcp_query`."
msgstr "通过 `ngx_resolver_send_tcp_query` 将该查询切换到 TCP。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:96 a041aee6979a4898b7ff91422231e372
msgid ""
"On a terminal RCODE the code sets `ctx->valid` to now plus the `resolver` "
"`valid=` time, or 10 seconds when `valid` is 0, then frees the name node. "
"Later lookups do not hit a stored negative entry in the rbtree."
msgstr ""
"遇到终态 RCODE 时，代码将 `ctx->valid` 设置为当前时间加上 `resolver` 的 `valid=` 时间；当 `valid` 为"
" 0 时为 10 秒，然后释放名称节点。后续查询不会命中红黑树中存储的否定条目。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:98 a1106a9fed2b43c1961a6ef0b30e0440
