#: ../../06-workflows.md:113 05034e0c7a8f4303966d393cbed4d974
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Upstream `proxy_pass` logs `%V could not be resolved (%i: %s)` and finalizes"
" with `NGX_HTTP_BAD_GATEWAY` for every non-zero `ctx->state`, including "
"timeout. A missing resolver is also 502. Only the immediate "
"`ngx_resolve_name` failure path is 500."
msgstr ""
"上游 `proxy_pass` 记录 `%V could not be resolved (%i: %s)`，并对每个非零 "
"`ctx->state`（包括超时）以 `NGX_HTTP_BAD_GATEWAY` 终结。缺少 resolver 也是 502。只有 "
"`ngx_resolve_name` 立即失败的路径是 500。"

