#: ../../06-workflows.md:124 0a661987d98e4c9b82b5fa90bd66d55a
msgid "Workflow 2 — Build and Publish the PKB Site"
msgstr "工作流 2 —— 构建并发布知识库站点"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:128 b820e149c7f6400b82ab24d3dcd1b23e
msgid ""
"**Trigger**: A maintainer (or CI) wants to produce the bilingual site and "
"put it online."
msgstr "**触发条件**：维护者（或 CI）想要生成双语站点并上线。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:130 9567ff96dd064404a62d873017b2afef
msgid ""
"**Goal**: From clean sources, verify a strict build and push static HTML to "
"GitHub Pages."
msgstr "**目标**：从干净源码出发，验证严格构建并把静态 HTML 推送到 GitHub Pages。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:135 31210919546b4fffb6b867a302914d87
msgid ""
"`make deps` -> `uv sync --locked` installs the pinned Sphinx toolchain."
msgstr "`make deps` -> `uv sync --locked` 安装固定版本的 Sphinx 工具链。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:136 323593a3a2264163b63ddc6b1599ee0e
msgid ""
"`make build` (Sphinx `-W -n`) renders English and zh_CN into `_build/site/`."
msgstr "`make build`（Sphinx `-W -n`）把英文和 zh_CN 渲染到 `_build/site/`。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:137 5713499914424d23a80b8ac2fbe25d26
msgid ""
"A landing `index.html` redirects visitors to `/en/` or `/zh/` by browser "
"language."
msgstr "落地页 `index.html` 根据浏览器语言把访客重定向到 `/en/` 或 `/zh/`。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:139 ddd387554605428aa3c9d25ad844f9eb
msgid ""
"`make publish` creates/refreshes a `gh-pages` worktree, copies "
"`_build/site/*`, adds `.nojekyll`, commits, and pushes."
msgstr ""
"`make publish` 创建/刷新 `gh-pages` worktree，复制 `_build/site/*`，添加 "
"`.nojekyll`，提交并推送。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:144 90a7cd7c2235432a927ae66febfe06b2
msgid ""
"`doc/Makefile html-en` / `html-zh` / `render_landing.py` drive each build."
msgstr "`doc/Makefile html-en` / `html-zh` / `render_landing.py` 驱动每次构建。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:145 6b618389047b4871af6a00fab48e626d
msgid ""
"`make publish` uses `git worktree add` on `gh-pages` so the source branch is"
" untouched."
msgstr "`make publish` 在 `gh-pages` 上使用 `git worktree add`，因此源分支不受影响。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:148 ab1f2c463cae493c86b79c1eaf3db90e
msgid "Workflow 3 — Refresh the Chinese (zh_CN) Translation"
msgstr "工作流 3 —— 刷新中文本地化"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:152 005f6137bcda452480069572f7b22b03
msgid ""
"**Trigger**: English sources changed, so the zh_CN build would otherwise "
"fall back to English."
msgstr "**触发条件**：英文源码变更，否则 zh_CN 构建会回退为英文。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:154 1f11b8c38a9b4f1aaed7d1691c54f7ff
msgid ""
"**Goal**: Re-extract msgids, merge into `.po`, translate the new strings, "
"and compile `.mo` so the zh site matches the English source."
msgstr "**目标**：重新提取 msgid，合并进 `.po`，翻译新字符串并编译 `.mo`，使中文站点与英文源一致。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:159 cc47b5dfa558471881ff263373acfb0d
msgid ""
"`sphinx-build -b gettext . _build/gettext` regenerates `.pot` catalogs."
msgstr "`sphinx-build -b gettext . _build/gettext` 重新生成 `.pot` 目录。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:160 bd1e03ac486f4ef1bfc54e52e0c2298e
msgid ""
"`sphinx-intl update --pot-dir _build/gettext --locale-dir locale -l zh_CN` "
"merges into `locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/*.po` (msgmerge semantics preserve "
"existing translations)."
msgstr ""
"`sphinx-intl update --pot-dir _build/gettext --locale-dir locale -l zh_CN` "
"合并进 `locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/*.po`（msgmerge 语义会保留已有翻译）。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:163 174262fc0525413f9012982a5e41efef
msgid "Translate new `msgid`s, then `sphinx-intl build` compiles `.mo`."
msgstr "翻译新的 `msgid`，然后通过 `sphinx-intl build` 编译 `.mo`。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:164 79375f60c6d342c5b5f640aac17bf22a
msgid "`make build` renders the zh site; `make pkb-check-i18n` verifies sync."
msgstr "`make build` 渲染中文站点；`make pkb-check-i18n` 验证同步。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:166 683eca28d0d14fc5ae1ffc986d9bf04f
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:168 28a08c03d7e741cfb1c2fde6066b3ab0
msgid ""
"Keep the English page as the single source of truth; never edit `.mo` by "
"hand."
msgstr "把英文页面作为唯一事实来源；绝不要手工编辑 `.mo`。"

#: ../../06-workflows.md:169 1b1fe88272404055a6ab04971f129013
msgid ""
"The whole-module ingest page (`08-lua-nginx-module.md`) is a verbatim "
"upstream reference and intentionally falls back to English in zh_CN."
msgstr "整模块摄取页（`08-lua-nginx-module.md`）是上游原文的逐字引用，在 zh_CN 中刻意回退为英文。"

